  "original_findings": [
    {
      "id": "quote_field_offset_not_bound",
      "severity": "blocking_for_claimed_field_integrity",
      "file": "experiments/judgment-review/replay.js",
      "reason": "field.includes(q.text)只证明相同文字在声明字段出现，不证明q.start/end所在原始JSON字串就是该字段。同一句重复于answer和factor时可把answer偏移错标到factor且通过。应建立原始JSON字符串token与字段路径的位置映射，检查偏移处于声明字段token范围；支持UTF16和JSON转义。",
      "status": "resolved",
      "resolution": "真实JSON字符串token区间与声明字段绑定，重复文字的另一字段偏移被拒绝；direction属性键特例仍限制在该字段key/value区间。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sse_not_connected_to_response",
      "severity": "blocking_for_claimed_full_replay_integrity",
      "file": "experiments/judgment-review/replay.js",
      "reason": "SSE仅校验自身archive元数据，不对冻结SSE重新parse并比较rawText、usage、finishReason、sawDone、error与response/check，也不核对check.archive同archive。替换成只有DONE的流并更新archive的大小/hash会通过，回复仍原值。应从完整SSE重建回复并核对连接。",
      "status": "resolved",
      "resolution": "冻结完整SSE重新解析并对照rawText/usage/finish/done/error，同时核对check.archive元数据；连双方metadata一致改写也不能绕过回复连接。"
    }
  ],
